    135  0be0							; RESTORE (top B of the overlay) is a command key.
    136  0be0							; Every press: downbeat re-sync. A second press within DOUBLE_TAP ms: also
    137  0be0							; cycle the video mode (the single action stays immediate so re-sync lands
    138  0be0							; on the beat).
